OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer, 17, waits three
OL,4,Ayears for dream shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old photographer who waited
OL,7,Fthree years to capture the perfect
OL,8,Faction shot has scooped the top title
OL,9,Fin a wildlife photography competition.
OL,11,FMaksym Breus said he spent more than
OL,12,F200 hours studying birds before taking
OL,13,Fa "dream shot" of a hobby brandishing
OL,14,Fits talons ready to pounce on a
OL,15,Fdragonfly over water at Redgrave and
OL,16,FLopham Fen, on the Norfolk-Suffolk
OL,17,Fborder, near Diss.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
