OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer, 17, waits three
OL,4,Ayears for dream shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis dedication has seen him win Norfolk
OL,7,FWildlife Trust's (NWT) annual contest,
OL,8,Fwith his image one of 12 winning
OL,9,Fphotographs to be featured in its 2027
OL,10,Fcalendar.
OL,12,F"After more than 200 hours spent
OL,13,Fobserving, the delight of achieving my
OL,14,Fdream shot was absolutely
OL,15,Findescribable," he said.
